<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.720" end="00:00:08.000" style="s2">So, I&#39;m going to South Carolina.</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.000" end="00:00:11.360" style="s2">We&#39;re going to hopefully get Darleen</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.000" end="00:00:13.720" style="s2">Graham elected. She&#39;s fantastic.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.360" end="00:00:15.400" style="s2">Sister Lindsey, and</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.720" end="00:00:17.000" style="s2">we have a tremendous crowd as we have</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.400" end="00:00:19.000" style="s2">always had.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.000" end="00:00:21.480" style="s2">And I think it&#39;ll be an amazing day. We</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.000" end="00:00:24.680" style="s2">had a very good meeting just now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.480" end="00:00:26.520" style="s2">As you know, on cyber cyber security.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.680" end="00:00:28.640" style="s2">And that&#39;s in full play, and we&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.520" end="00:00:30.600" style="s2">to do very well. Should have been done</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.640" end="00:00:33.040" style="s2">many years ago by</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.600" end="00:00:34.480" style="s2">other administrations.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.040" end="00:00:36.960" style="s2">And you have any quick questions? Go</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.480" end="00:00:36.960" style="s2">ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.480" end="00:00:45.360" style="s2">Where is this? Where?</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.600" end="00:00:55.320" style="s2">I don&#39;t know anything about it. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.280" end="00:00:57.160" style="s2">that there&#39;s something where his her</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.320" end="00:00:58.840" style="s2">mother went against her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.160" end="00:01:01.160" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what that has to do with</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.840" end="00:01:03.160" style="s2">the thing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.160" end="00:01:04.519" style="s2">I just don&#39;t know that. And</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.160" end="00:01:06.160" style="s2">as you know,</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.519" end="00:01:08.000" style="s2">well, I guess you know, if it was about</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.160" end="00:01:10.120" style="s2">a Republican, I can guarantee you they&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.000" end="00:01:12.560" style="s2">let it go. So, that&#39;s why you&#39;re asking.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.120" end="00:01:15.920" style="s2">The fact is I know nothing about it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.560" end="00:01:17.440" style="s2">But, I hear the mother went very rogue</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.920" end="00:01:19.160" style="s2">on the daughter, doesn&#39;t have a lot of</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.440" end="00:01:21.160" style="s2">respect for the daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.160" end="00:01:23.600" style="s2">And I think the mother is a witness to</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.160" end="00:01:25.880" style="s2">things also. So, who knows? And you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.600" end="00:01:28.640" style="s2">have to figure that out. It&#39;s a very</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.880" end="00:01:30.600" style="s2">unusual situation to have a mother hate</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.640" end="00:01:34.560" style="s2">a daughter that much. But, I don&#39;t think</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.600" end="00:01:34.560" style="s2">that has anything to do with the thing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.920" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">I don&#39;t know that they are. I mean,</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.840" end="00:01:50.160" style="s2">you&#39;re telling me something. I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:50.160" style="s2">know that.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.960" end="00:01:59.800" style="s2">Well, I&#39;ll tell you the interesting</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.520" end="00:02:02.200" style="s2">thing</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.800" end="00:02:04.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is you know we have a gentleman coming</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.200" end="00:02:05.800" style="s2">home from Russia that they&#39;ve been after</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.200" end="00:02:08.039" style="s2">for years. He was</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.800" end="00:02:09.880" style="s2">uh captured or taken during the Biden</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.039" end="00:02:11.840" style="s2">administration. Uh wouldn&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.880" end="00:02:13.080" style="s2">happened if I were president, but he he</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.840" end="00:02:15.800" style="s2">was taken</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.080" end="00:02:16.640" style="s2">and he&#39;s a highly respected man, Mr. Hu</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.800" end="00:02:18.040" style="s2">bbard.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.640" end="00:02:20.959" style="s2">Stephen Hubbard.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.040" end="00:02:22.840" style="s2">And we were in the midst of negotiating</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.959" end="00:02:25.600" style="s2">and a lot of stupid people said and</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.840" end="00:02:27.040" style="s2">people that don&#39;t know how life works,</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.600" end="00:02:29.280" style="s2">they said, &quot;Why aren&#39;t you putting</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.040" end="00:02:31.320" style="s2">righteous sanctions or all this in the</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.280" end="00:02:35.280" style="s2">midst of a negotiation to try and get a</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.320" end="00:02:36.760" style="s2">long-term hostage back from uh Russia?&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.280" end="00:02:38.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Russia anything in exchange?</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.760" end="00:02:40.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I would have done that, you would not</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.280" end="00:02:42.520" style="s2">have Mr. Hubbard coming back. Right now,</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.920" end="00:02:44.640" style="s2">right now and you don&#39;t know anything. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.520" end="00:02:47.280" style="s2">mean, you&#39;re fake news CNN. Look, right</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.640" end="00:02:49.760" style="s2">now you have a man that&#39;s beautifully</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.280" end="00:02:52.200" style="s2">flying from Russia to wherever he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.760" end="00:02:54.720" style="s2">landing in the United States that I got</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.200" end="00:02:57.920" style="s2">out because I had a very good and very</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.720" end="00:02:59.800" style="s2">fast negotiation with President Putin.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.920" end="00:03:01.720" style="s2">If you would have put those sanctions on</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.800" end="00:03:03.200" style="s2">or whatever you want to call them, uh</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.720" end="00:03:04.880" style="s2">you could forget about him. You&#39;d never</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.200" end="00:03:07.080" style="s2">see him again. He&#39;d be back in jail for</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.880" end="00:03:09.400" style="s2">25 years. The other thing, very</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.080" end="00:03:11.560" style="s2">important, when negotiating with Russia</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.400" end="00:03:14.239" style="s2">right now on Ukraine,</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.560" end="00:03:16.560" style="s2">uh we are maybe close to a deal for the</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.239" end="00:03:18.519" style="s2">first time in a long time. We&#39;re maybe</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.560" end="00:03:19.959" style="s2">close to a deal. When you&#39;re close to a</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.519" end="00:03:22.600" style="s2">deal and you have very delicate</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.959" end="00:03:25.800" style="s2">negotiations, you don&#39;t put sanctions</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.600" end="00:03:28.720" style="s2">on. And the other thing, we have uh</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.800" end="00:03:31.440" style="s2">decimated Iran. Russia has had very</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.720" end="00:03:33.120" style="s2">little input into Iran. They have</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.440" end="00:03:34.920" style="s2">Certainly, they could have done a lot</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.120" end="00:03:37.120" style="s2">more, but I&#39;m not sure they did almost</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.920" end="00:03:39.120" style="s2">anything. Uh that&#39;s something that you</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.120" end="00:03:42.120" style="s2">have to take into consideration also.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.120" end="00:03:45.120" style="s2">So, we beat Iran. We continue to beat</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.120" end="00:03:47.800" style="s2">Iran and Russia and China, frankly, have</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.120" end="00:03:49.959" style="s2">not been certainly much of a player and</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.800" end="00:03:52.239" style="s2">we appreciate that. So, the people that</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.959" end="00:03:53.680" style="s2">say that, &quot;Oh, let&#39;s put sanctions on.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.239" end="00:03:57.160" style="s2">You know, I have the right to do them at</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.680" end="00:03:58.920" style="s2">any day. If If they behave badly, if</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.160" end="00:03:59.880" style="s2">they be</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.920" end="00:04:01.640" style="s2">You don&#39;t know what you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.880" end="00:04:03.280" style="s2">about. You&#39;re a dummy. You&#39;re a low IQ</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.640" end="00:04:06.000" style="s2">person. You&#39;re a dummy and you work for</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.280" end="00:04:08.640" style="s2">CNN. Let me tell you, if I&#39;m negotiating</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.000" end="00:04:11.480" style="s2">to get a man back, a man that we wanted</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.640" end="00:04:14.720" style="s2">back for years, a man that was a</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.480" end="00:04:16.079" style="s2">prisoner in Siberia or some place in</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.720" end="00:04:18.079" style="s2">Russia, and we&#39;re getting him back</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.079" end="00:04:19.760" style="s2">because of me. Should have been brought</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.079" end="00:04:21.040" style="s2">It should have never happened, but it</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.760" end="00:04:22.720" style="s2">should have been brought back during</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.040" end="00:04:25.840" style="s2">Biden cuz he was there with during the</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.720" end="00:04:28.040" style="s2">Biden. It was He was captured or taken</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.840" end="00:04:30.440" style="s2">during Biden. When you&#39;re negotiating</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.040" end="00:04:32.960" style="s2">that and you&#39;re dropping and I know that</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.440" end="00:04:35.120" style="s2">I&#39;m doing it and because a lot of people</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.960" end="00:04:37.840" style="s2">didn&#39;t know and they say, &quot;Oh, let&#39;s put</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.120" end="00:04:39.919" style="s2">sanctions on Russia.&quot; The negotiation</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.840" end="00:04:43.680" style="s2">would obviously come immediately to an</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.919" end="00:04:43.680" style="s2">end. So, use your head.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.720" end="00:04:53.880" style="s2">I don&#39;t I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.360" end="00:04:54.760" style="s2">No, I think it&#39;s one of the greatest</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.880" end="00:04:57.040" style="s2">things</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.760" end="00:04:58.400" style="s2">I think it&#39;s one of the greatest I think</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.040" end="00:05:00.520" style="s2">it&#39;s one of the greatest things we&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.400" end="00:05:02.960" style="s2">done. We&#39;ve stopped Iran from having a</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.520" end="00:05:04.560" style="s2">nuclear weapon. It&#39;s one of the best</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.960" end="00:05:06.520" style="s2">things that we&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.560" end="00:05:08.320" style="s2">Uh it took a lot of courage to do it</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.520" end="00:05:10.840" style="s2">because no other president was willing</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.320" end="00:05:13.280" style="s2">to do it. And if we didn&#39;t do it, Iran</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.840" end="00:05:17.120" style="s2">would right now have already used</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.280" end="00:05:17.120" style="s2">massive nuclear weapons.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.000" end="00:05:28.440" style="s2">No, I wasn&#39;t involved. I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.960" end="00:05:33.080" style="s2">I don&#39;t know who did it, but I was not</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.640" end="00:05:33.080" style="s2">involved.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.720" end="00:05:43.560" style="s2">Are you a stupid person? Who do you work</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.560" end="00:05:45.280" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.560" end="00:05:48.960" style="s2">You&#39;re a stupid person. And by the way,</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.280" end="00:05:48.960" style="s2">your network is the worst of all.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.960" end="00:05:59.120" style="s2">Yeah, we would have a meeting. We would</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.480" end="00:06:02.040" style="s2">certainly have that as a meeting. Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.120" end="00:06:02.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How confident are you</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.240" end="00:06:07.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t say I can&#39;t say that it&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.000" end="00:06:10.840" style="s2">to happen, but having a meeting on</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.040" end="00:06:10.840" style="s2">denuclearization is a very good thing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.560" end="00:06:25.240" style="s2">I haven&#39;t heard it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.680" end="00:06:34.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Recently your Treasury Department</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.360" end="00:06:37.160" style="s2">announced sanctions against the cartels</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.360" end="00:06:39.480" style="s2">in the West exposing the Mexican cartels</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.160" end="00:06:40.120" style="s2">of their abuse of the American quarter</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.480" end="00:06:40.600" style="s2">horses.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.120" end="00:06:42.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.600" end="00:06:44.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, are you going to launch a full</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.240" end="00:06:45.160" style="s2">investigation on these cartels?</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.280" end="00:06:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; do.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.160" end="00:06:48.960" style="s2">And I always have. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.800" end="00:06:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
